    <briefdescription>
<para>File Management Module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This module contains FORTRAN units and file names for the canopy model. It manages input and output file specifications including variable files, canopy profile files, output files, and the namelist file.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Patrick C. Campbell </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>July 2022</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="version"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>15 Jul 2022: Original version (P. C. Campbell)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>30 Nov 2023: Added supplementary canopy profile, file_canvars (P.C. Campbell) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
